ecific foods. This condition often leads to gastrointestinal symptoms, necessitating dietary adjustments to manage and alleviate the associated discomfort."}{"title": "ELAMIN MF:Elamin MF is a researcher involved in the study of lactose persistence and its genetic factors."}{"title": "MULCARE CA:Mulcare CA is a researcher who has worked on genetic studies related to lactose tolerance."}{"title": "WEALE ME:Weale ME is a researcher who has contributed to the understanding of genetic adaptation in human populations."}{"title": "TAREKEGN A:Tarekegn A is a researcher involved in studies on human genetics and lactose persistence."}{"title": "RAGA TO:Raga TO is a researcher who has contributed to the field of genetics, particularly in relation to lactose tolerance."}{"title": "SCRIMSHAW NS:Scrimshaw NS is a researcher known for his work on nutrition and lactose intolerance."}{"title": "MURRAY EB:Murray EB is a researcher who has studied the acceptability of milk products in lactose intolerant populations."}{"title": "FERN\u00c1NDEZ-BA\u00d1ARES F:Fern\u00e1ndez-Ba\u00f1ares F is a researcher specializing in gastrointestinal disorders and their dietary implications. He has conducted significant research on the effectiveness of enteral nutrition specifically in the context of Crohn's disease, contributing valuable insights to the field."}{"title": "ESTEVE M:Esteve M is a researcher who has studied fructose malabsorption and its effects on health."}{"title": "VIVER JM:Viver JM is a researcher involved in studies on fructose malabsorption."}{"title": "FRIELING T:Frieling T is a researcher who has studied fructose malabsorption and dietary tolerance."}{"title": "KUHLBUSCH-ZICKLAM R:Kuhlbusch-Zicklam R is a researcher focused on dietary fructose and its effects on health."}{"title": "KALDE S:Kalde S is a researcher who has contributed to studies on fructose malabsorption."}{"title": "HEISE J:Heise J is a researcher involved in the study of dietary fructose tolerance."}{"title": 